<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs firm-up $.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs firm-up $.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were firm to $0.50 higher. Demand and supplies were moderate. Top $55.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>			   Country			     Plants</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 53.00-54.00 Few 52.50 &amp; 54.50</p>
<p>								  53.50-55.25</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs. 46.50-52.50</p>
<p>	  210-230 lbs. 41.50-46.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Unevenly Steady. US 1-3   300-450 lbs. 41.00-45.50</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs. 45.00-47.00</p>
<p>	   500-650 lbs. 48.00-53.50 Few over 650 lbs. 54.00</p>
